        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazes. Magic. Multiplayer chaos. And… golf?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaving the Labyrinth</strong> is a wild blend of dungeon-crawling and crystal-putting, where you and up to 7 friends must <i>golf your way to freedom</i>. Armed with enchanted power and questionable aim, your party must launch magical crystals into dormant portals to escape each floor of a mysterious, monster-filled labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn’t your average golf game. The dungeon is alive with danger: hostile creatures, cursed traps, chaotic physics, and your own teammates’ “helpful” swings. Success requires precision, coordination… and probably a lot of shouting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818270/extras/2f5ebdcf30d4e86d20a46c3d586f7edd.avif?t=1765821927\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818270/extras_big/2f5ebdcf30d4e86d20a46c3d586f7edd.avif?t=1765821927 width=1600 height=1036 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golf meets dungeon crawler</strong>: Navigate procedurally generated mazes filled with monsters, hazards, and magical mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanted physics-based gameplay</strong>: Use spell-charged golf shots to bounce, ricochet, or blast crystals across bizarre terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic 8-player online co-op</strong>: Perfect for party nights, game nights, or testing the limits of your friendships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Striking magical visuals</strong>: Dark, mysterious environments glow with arcane energy, creating a uniquely atmospheric world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for laughs</strong>: Not every shot will be perfect—and that’s the fun. Expect hilarious mishaps, epic saves, and a lot of “oops.”</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're the precision putter or the chaotic caster, <strong>Leaving the Labyrinth</strong> is built for memorable moments and magical mayhem. Can your group escape the maze… or will you be stuck forever yelling, “Who hit that crystal?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818270/extras/6ab8d056542fa5e77dd2ea6a43a1ec7f.avif?t=1765821927\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818270/extras_big/6ab8d056542fa5e77dd2ea6a43a1ec7f.avif?t=1765821927 width=800 height=391 /></span></p>",
